0..63 Comment "// This source uses named session types as endpoint parameters."
64..66 Comment "//"
67..104 Comment "// A program names its protocol once."
105..137 Comment "// Each endpoint uses that name."
138..180 Comment "// A top-level type can name the protocol."
181..234 Comment "// A module manifest component can name the protocol."
235..268 Comment "// An alias can name either type."
269..271 Comment "//"
272..332 Comment "// The lowering resolves each name to its definition\'s type."
